{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/items/202161/", "pk": 202161, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/", "pk": 5980, "shortname": "unlimitedbiking", "name": "Unlimited Biking", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "The Highlights of San Francisco Bike Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "The Highlights of San Francisco Bike Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 4.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": -2.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 53000, "description": "##Duration\n\n4 Hours\n\n#About\n\nThis guided ride is your introduction to the city’s colorful history and cultures, with routes through its most vibrant neighborhoods, including the Mission, Castro, Haight-Ashbury, and Alamo Square. You’ll see how SF has been shaped by waves of settlers, from Spanish missionaries to Silicon Valley techies. Join us as we pedal past dazzling murals, Victorian row houses, famous viewpoints, thriving commercial districts, and gems of Golden Gate Park.\n\nYou’ll surely come away with new perspectives on the city after visiting:\n\n**Ghirardelli Square:** Our Start and End Location.\n**Alamo Square:**  Home to the Painted Ladies and one of the most iconic views in the city.\n**Nopa:**  Residential neighborhood filled with Victorian architecture.\n**Panhandle:**  The handle to Golden Gate Park’s “pan,” this narrow park boasts redwood, cypress, and pine trees.\n**Golden Gate Park:**  The city’s ultimate treasure, it is where we go to run, ride, play, and think.\n**Haight-Ashbury:**  The famous 1960’s hippie hangout and former home to the Grateful Dead, Janis Joplin, and more.\n**Lower Haight:**  Less famous than its Haight sibling up the hill, Lower Haight boasts hip shops, local bars, and the famous Wiggle bike route.\n**Castro:**  Vibrant, colorful, and rooted in activism, the Castro is sure to put a smile on your face.\n**Mission:**  Dynamic neighborhood with Latino roots and an abundance of historic murals.\n\n*We don’t stop for lunch on this tour, but we do include a snack stop.*\n\nAll guests must be able to ride their own bicycles. Attachments such as double trailers and tagalong bikes are not permitted for the safety of the group.\n\n**Tour Times:**\n9:30AM Daily\n\n**Tips**\nDress appropriately  for the weather and don't forget your camera!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "757 Beach Street San Francisco, CA 94109", "booking_notes": "We are excited to have you join our amazing tour guides on an adventure through San Francisco! This tour is approximately 4 hours long and covers all the must-see sights!\n\nPlease try to arrive 10-15 minutes before your tour's starting time to check in with our team and meet your guide! Your outfit should be seasonally suitable; we also suggest that you dress in something comfy, not too loose, and closed-toe shoes. Don't forget a proper ID and your camera!\n\n**Know Before You Go:**\n\n- All children must be *one year or older* to be on any bike/bike attachments.\n- Any riders who are under 18 years of age must have an adult present to check in and sign the waiver form in behalf of them. We require a valid identity card upon check in.\n- For all our riders' safety, we are not able to accommodate any riders who are 300 pounds and over as this exceeds the weight limit the manufacturer has advised for the bike's build. We apologize for the inconvenience, but we do prioritize your safety during the ride. \n\nIf anything from the list above concerns you or any members of your party, please feel free to reach out to our team by responding to this email. We will get back to you as soon as we can!", "cancellation_notes": "**Bike Tour Cancellation Policy**\n\nPlease notify us at sales@unlimitedbiking.com at least 24 hours in advance if you cannot make your tour.\n\nFor any cancellations within 24 hours of the tour, we can provide a full credit in the amount you have paid towards bike rentals that will never expire!\n\nIn the event of inclement weather, our team will contact you in advance for any tour cancellations.\n\nPlease note: If you reschedule your booking for a later date, we must receive your cancellation request 24 hours before your original travel date. If you reschedule for an earlier date, the 24 hour cancellation window applies to your new travel date.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "4 Hours • All Ages!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/items/202161/images/355394/", "pk": 355394, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vKmop1eQIyYFjjTDnI7F", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vKmop1eQIyYFjjTDnI7F", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/items/202161/"}, "crop": {"y": 0, "x": 0, "width": 1747, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/mXxIADBcSjKoZMd8xSgB", "height": 919}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/mXxIADBcSjKoZMd8xSgB", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestac